// Fachliche Ausprägungen der mikrobiologischen Untersuchung.
// Erbt über Parent die gemeinsamen Angaben aus MII_LM_Mikrobio_Untersuchung; hier stehen ausschließlich
// die Attribute, die das jeweilige Profil selbst festlegt (code, value[x], method, interpretation, derivedFrom).
Logical: MII_LM_Mikrobio_Untersuchungsarten
Parent: MII_LM_Mikrobio_Untersuchung
Id: mii-lm-mikrobio-untersuchungsarten
Title: "MII LM Microbiology Investigation Types"
Description: "Specialisations of the microbiological investigation for the graphical representation of the 2027 microbiology data model"
* insert PR_CS_VS_Version
* insert Publisher
* . ^short = "Microbiological investigation types"
* . ^definition = "The specialisations of a microbiological investigation. Each specialisation adds its specific attributes to the common information inherited from MII_LM_Mikrobio_Untersuchung."

// Kultur
* Kultur 0..* BackboneElement "Culture" "Culture-based and microscopic investigations and the subsequent susceptibility testing."
  * AllgemeineKultur 0..* BackboneElement "General culture" "Result of an untargeted microbiological culture that checks whether any microorganism grows in the specimen."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the investigation; fixed here: detection of a microorganism by culture (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Growth or no growth in the specimen (SNOMED CT). An indeterminable result is represented not here but via the data absent reason."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Culture procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
  * AllgemeineMikroskopie 0..* BackboneElement "General microscopy" "Morphological observation of microorganisms by microscopic examination. The result is a morphological group, not a species."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the investigation; microscopic observation (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Observed morphology (SNOMED CT)."
    * Menge[x] 0..1 CodeableConcept or Quantity or Range "Quantity" "How much of the reported finding was seen: as a semiquantitative grade (SNOMED CT) or as a count per field of view (UCUM)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Microscopic procedure used (SNOMED CT). The staining technique is stated alongside."
  * SpezifischeMikroskopie 0..* BackboneElement "Specific microscopy" "Microscopic detection of an object named in the investigation code; the quantity seen is stated alongside."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the object sought and the staining technique (LOINC, ordinal scale)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Detection or exclusion of the object sought (SNOMED CT)."
    * Menge[x] 0..1 CodeableConcept or Quantity or Range "Quantity" "How much of the detected object was seen: as a semiquantitative grade (SNOMED CT) or as a count per field of view (UCUM)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Microscopic procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
  * BartlettScore 0..* BackboneElement "Bartlett Score" "Qualitative microscopic assessment of the suitability of sputum specimens for culture based on the ratio of inflammatory to epithelial cells."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the investigation; fixed here: Bartlett score (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Score category and the specimen suitability derived from it (LOINC)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Procedure used; fixed here: microscopy (SNOMED CT)."
  * NugentScore 0..* BackboneElement "Nugent Score" "Gram-stain-based semiquantitative scoring system for assessing vaginal microbiota patterns in bacterial vaginosis."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the investigation; fixed here: Nugent score (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 Quantity "Result" "Score value of the Nugent score (dimensionless)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Procedure used; fixed here: microscopy (SNOMED CT)."
  * Keimzahl 0..* BackboneElement "Colony count" "Quantitative determination of viable microorganisms in a specimen as colony-forming units per volume or mass."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the colony count (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 Quantity "Result" "Measured colony count with unit, e.g. CFU/mL (UCUM)."
    * Bewertung 0..1 CodeableConcept "Assessment" "Semiquantitative classification of the measured value, e.g. scant / moderate / abundant growth."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Procedure used; fixed here: counting (SNOMED CT)."
  * Empfindlichkeit 0..* BackboneElement "Susceptibility" "Result of phenotypic resistance testing of a pathogen against an antimicrobial substance with reference to a norm system."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Antimicrobial substance tested and test procedure (LOINC). Codes without a pre-coordinated specimen type are preferred."
    * Ergebnis[x] 0..1 Quantity or CodeableConcept "Result" "Measured value of the susceptibility test, e.g. minimum inhibitory concentration in mg/L or inhibition zone diameter in mm (UCUM) — or, if nothing was measured, the susceptibility category."
    * Bewertung 0..1 BackboneElement "Assessment" "Categorical assessment of the measured value (susceptible / intermediate / resistant)."
      * Kategorie 1..1 CodeableConcept "Category" "Susceptibility category of the pathogen tested."
      * Norm 1..1 CodeableConcept "Norm" "Norm system including version on whose breakpoints the category is based, e.g. EUCAST or CLSI."

// Bestimmung
* Bestimmung 0..* BackboneElement "Determination" "Identification or detection of a microorganism or infectious agent in a specimen."
  * AllgemeineBestimmung 0..* BackboneElement "General determination" "Identification of a microorganism or infectious agent without restriction to a predefined target."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the investigation; fixed here: detection of a microorganism or agent in the specimen (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Identified microorganism or agent (SNOMED CT)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Detection or identification procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
  * SpezifischeBestimmung 0..* BackboneElement "Specific determination" "Qualitative detection of a predefined microbial target, culture-based or by molecular, immunological or biochemical procedures. The procedure used is in the investigation code and in the method, not in the result."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the target sought and the test procedure (LOINC). Codes without a pre-coordinated specimen type are preferred."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Detection result for the target sought (SNOMED CT)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Detection procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
  * CtWert 0..* BackboneElement "Ct value" "Cycle threshold in nucleic acid detection, e.g. real-time PCR."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the Ct value for the respective target (LOINC). Codes without a pre-coordinated specimen type are preferred."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 Quantity "Result" "Cycle threshold (dimensionless)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Procedure used; fixed here: real-time PCR (SNOMED CT)."
    * AbgeleitetAus 0..* Reference(MII_LM_Mikrobio_Untersuchung) "Derived from" "Investigation from which the Ct value originated, usually the associated specific determination."

// Weitere Eigenschaften
* WeitereEigenschaften 0..* BackboneElement "Further properties" "Additional properties of a detected pathogen, in particular regarding virulence and resistance."
  * Virulenzfaktor 0..* BackboneElement "Virulence factor" "Qualitative detection or exclusion of virulence determinants in a specimen."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the virulence determinant investigated (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Detected or not detected (SNOMED CT)."
  * ResistenzmechanismenDeterminanten 0..* BackboneElement "Resistance mechanism" "Detection of resistance genes or resistance mutations as an indication of a specific resistance mechanism."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the resistance gene or resistance mechanism investigated (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Detected or not detected (SNOMED CT)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Detection procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
  * MRGNKlasse 0..* BackboneElement "MRGN class" "Classification of multidrug-resistant Gram-negative pathogens according to the RKI categorisation."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the investigation; fixed here: MRGN classification (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "MRGN class, e.g. 3MRGN or 4MRGN (LOINC)."
  * VoraussichtlicheEmpfindlichkeit 0..* BackboneElement "Predicted susceptibility" "Expected susceptibility or resistance to antimicrobial substances derived from genotypic detections."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Antimicrobial substance or substance class concerned (LOINC, genotypic)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Expected susceptibility or resistance."
  * ResistenzkategorieStatus 0..* BackboneElement "Resistance category status" "Assessment of a pathogen with regard to a defined resistance category, e.g. MRSA, VRE, LRE or LVRE, derived from the available microbiological investigations."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Assessed resistance category (MII CodeSystem)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 CodeableConcept "Result" "Positive or Negative with regard to the category named in the investigation code (SNOMED CT)."
    * Grundlage 0..* BackboneElement "Basis" "Investigations from which the assessment was derived: identification, susceptibility and resistance mechanisms."
  * Aviditaet 0..* BackboneElement "Avidity" "Assessment of the binding strength of antibodies to a specific antigen, typically to distinguish recent from past infections."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the avidity test including target antigen (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 Quantity "Result" "Avidity index in percent."
    * Bewertung 0..1 CodeableConcept "Assessment" "Categorical classification of avidity, e.g. low or high."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Immunological procedure used (SNOMED CT)."

// Quantitative Tests
* QuantitativeTests 0..* BackboneElement "Quantitative Tests" "Quantitative measurements of pathogen-specific analytes."
  * AntigenAntikoerperQuantitativ 0..* BackboneElement "Antigen antibody tests" "Quantitative measurement of pathogen-specific antigens or antibodies by immunological procedures."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the antigen or antibody measured (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 Quantity "Result" "Measured concentration or activity with unit (UCUM)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Immunological procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
  * Titer 0..* BackboneElement "Titre" "Semiquantitative measurement from serial dilution series, reported as a ratio, e.g. 1:160."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the titre test (LOINC)."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 Ratio "Result" "Titre as a ratio; the numerator is always 1, the denominator gives the highest still reactive dilution step."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Dilution series procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
  * MolekularePathogenlast 0..* BackboneElement "Molecular pathogen load" "Quantitative measurement of the nucleic acid concentration of a pathogen, typically as a concentration per volume."
    * Untersuchungscode 1..1 CodeableConcept "Investigation code" "Coding of the measured pathogen load including target (LOINC). Codes without a pre-coordinated specimen type are preferred."
    * Ergebnis 0..1 Quantity "Result" "Measured pathogen load with unit, e.g. copies/mL (UCUM)."
    * Untersuchungsmethode 0..1 CodeableConcept "Method" "Molecular procedure used (SNOMED CT)."
